1.1.0 (2026-09-10)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/104
- Updated PIP-CO Idle Frameworks with the lower-memory wake/service architecture used by the latest hardware-tested build.
- Added WAKE.JS as a lightweight 2-minute idle watcher that loads the fullscreen idle runner only when needed.
- Added reset-safe behavior: a true cold reboot/crash/power-loss reset disables Idle Frameworks, while normal same-session standby/off-to-on preserves the selected provider.
- Preserved the built-in PIP-BOY 3000 screensaver, dynamic Mesmetron provider discovery, and Pipquarium integration.
- Preserved live preview behavior and read-only radio/audio detection.
- Updated the built-in bomb renderer source while retaining the 12 fps-style 83 ms frame interval and existing audio behavior.

